    "text": "kchanews.com\nwebsite\nCharles City\nCharles City Man Back in Custody in Cerro Gordo County Jail, Faces New Charge\nBy Mark Pitz,\n1 days agoA Charles City man who failed to report back to a Mason City residential facility over the weekend is back in custody. The Iowa Department of Corrections issued an advisory Monday (09.08) morning that 38-year-old Dean Naeve had not reported back to the Beje Clark Residential Facility as required. But he’s back behind bars now.",
